["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">禁煙</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きんえん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"v-m\">戒烟；禁止吸烟；禁烟；（告示牌用语）禁止吸烟；请勿吸烟</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"228670\">いつ<ruby>禁煙<rp>(</rp><rt>きんえん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のサインを<ruby>消<rp>(</rp><rt>け</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>すのでしょうね。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">When will they turn off the no-smoking sign?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">金額</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きんがく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">金额；款项</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"101044\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にかなりの<ruby>金額<rp>(</rp><rt>きんがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>与<rp>(</rp><rt>あた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He gave her a considerable sum of money.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">金庫</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きんこ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">保险柜；保险箱；现金箱；金库；金库室；存款处；出纳室；金库；财务室；资金提供者</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"183030\"><ruby>貴重品<rp>(</rp><rt>きちょうひん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>金庫<rp>(</rp><rt>きんこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にしまっておきなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Put your valuables in the safe.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">禁止</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きんし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">禁止；禁令；制止</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"224615\">ここでは<ruby>煙草<rp>(</rp><rt>たばこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>禁止<rp>(</rp><rt>きんし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>されています。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">You are not supposed to smoke here.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">金銭</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きんせん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">金钱；现金</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"179651\"><ruby>金銭<rp>(</rp><rt>きんせん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のことで<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>争<rp>(</rp><rt>あらそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いになった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I had a quarrel with him over money.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">金属</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きんぞく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">金属</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">近代</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きんだい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">现代；当代；近代（日本历史时期，通常指明治维新至第二次世界大战结束）</span></div><div 