div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">議員</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぎいん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">议员；议会成员；国会议员</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"152201\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>もまた、<ruby>議員<rp>(</rp><rt>ぎいん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>一人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I&#x27;m a councillor, too.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">議会</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぎかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">议会；议院；国会</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"182900\"><ruby>議会<rp>(</rp><rt>ぎかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はさいごにけんかになった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The argument ended in a fight.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">技師</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぎし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">工程师；技术员</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"199853\">トムは<ruby>電気<rp>(</rp><rt>でんき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>技師<rp>(</rp><rt>ぎし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Tom is an electrical engineer.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">議長</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぎちょう</span></div><div clas